{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo offers complete play-throughs of Vega Chronicle with some features restricted that will be available in the full game. You can play in a tiny or small galaxy, but the full game will offer medium, large, and huge options. You can face up to two alien civilizations, while the full game will support up to five. You have access to the Elimination and Development victory conditions, while the Research and Culture conditions will also be available in the full game. You have access to tier 1 and tier 2 technology, which make up 3/5 of the research tree, but not tier 3 technology. Tier 1 ancestral virtues, the meta-progression bonuses that empower your civilizations, are available in the demo, while tier 2 and 3 ancestral virtues will be available in the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time combat uses semi-auto-battler mechanics. Command your fleets to dodge incoming fire, focus weapons on a dangerous enemy, or retreat to safety. You make the big decisions that shape the course of battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/1aba0007d6adf137447a9b9f609e5fb3.poster.avif?t=1752731989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/1aba0007d6adf137447a9b9f609e5fb3.webm?t=1752731989\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/1aba0007d6adf137447a9b9f609e5fb3.mp4?t=1752731989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Victory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's more than one way to dominate a galaxy. Will you build an economy that dwarfs all others? Or simply crush your opponents with military might? Be wary: other civilizations are striving for the same goals.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/d57e45578fb864324853d79c8b329d85.poster.avif?t=1752731989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/d57e45578fb864324853d79c8b329d85.webm?t=1752731989\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/d57e45578fb864324853d79c8b329d85.mp4?t=1752731989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diplomacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do your people grow weary of war? Sue for peace with an adversary. Running low on resources? Offer to sell some scientific knowledge. Once you discover alien civilizations and learn how to communicate with them, trade and negotiation create new opportunities for growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/1918d7994e7cff09f17aad7887b753ea.poster.avif?t=1752731989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/1918d7994e7cff09f17aad7887b753ea.webm?t=1752731989\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/1918d7994e7cff09f17aad7887b753ea.mp4?t=1752731989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Research</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You decide what technology to research to fit your play-style. Will you focus on diplomatic tools like Xenolinguistics and Empathic resonance? Research tech for building your economy, like Colony domes and Agro-nexus? Or develop weapons of war, like Destroyers and Missiles?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/0c4ce546dd8ea7072a99fe510dc34d9c.poster.avif?t=1752731989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/0c4ce546dd8ea7072a99fe510dc34d9c.webm?t=1752731989\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/0c4ce546dd8ea7072a99fe510dc34d9c.mp4?t=1752731989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871520?t=1752731989","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/5486d2a4925ed2c0f28851e86a42e00dde3dc500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752731989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/b6e13a7cf271aae8953b9f04a4b4c8bfbee57748/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752731989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/b6e13a7cf271aae8953b9f04a4b4c8bfbee57748/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752731989","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo offers complete play-throughs of Vega Chronicle with some features restricted that will be available in the full game. You can play in a tiny or small galaxy, but the full game will offer medium, large, and huge options. You can face up to two alien civilizations, while the full game will support up to five. You have access to the Elimination and Development victory conditions, while the Research and Culture conditions will also be available in the full game. You have access to tier 1 and tier 2 technology, which make up 3/5 of the research tree, but not tier 3 technology. Tier 1 ancestral virtues, the meta-progression bonuses that empower your civilizations, are available in the demo, while tier 2 and 3 ancestral virtues will be available in the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time combat uses semi-auto-battler mechanics. Command your fleets to dodge incoming fire, focus weapons on a dangerous enemy, or retreat to safety. You make the big decisions that shape the course of battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/1aba0007d6adf137447a9b9f609e5fb3.poster.avif?t=1752731989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/1aba0007d6adf137447a9b9f609e5fb3.webm?t=1752731989\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/1aba0007d6adf137447a9b9f609e5fb3.mp4?t=1752731989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Victory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's more than one way to dominate a galaxy. Will you build an economy that dwarfs all others? Or simply crush your opponents with military might? Be wary: other civilizations are striving for the same goals.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/d57e45578fb864324853d79c8b329d85.poster.avif?t=1752731989\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/d57e45578fb864324853d79c8b329d85.webm?t=1752731989\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871520/extras/d57e45578fb864324853d79c8b329d85.mp4?t=1752731989\" type=\"vi